== Effect ==
* On use, spawns a random [[coin]], [[heart]], [[bomb]], [[key]], [[battery]], [[pill]] or [[card]] near Isaac.
* {{transformation contribution|Bookworm}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Hearts are proportionally more likely to be generated, with {{e|Red Heart}}s, {{e|Soul Heart}}s and {{e|Black Heart}}s each having a 1/9 chance of being chosen, the other 6/9 being distributed among the other categories.
* {{dlc|r}} Each category has a 1/7 chance of being chosen.
* The card category includes [[rune]]s, {{p|Dice Shard}}, {{p|Emergency Contact}} and {{p|Cracked Key}}.
* {{dlc+|r}} The heart category has the following distribution:
:: {| class="wikitable"
! Type !! Chance
|-
| {{e|Red Heart}} || 48.3%
|-
| {{e|Soul Heart}} || 16.1%
|-
| {{e|Black Heart}} || 16.1%
|-
| {{e|Bone Heart|n}} || 6.4%
|-
| {{e|Rotten Heart|n}} || 6.4%
|-
| {{e|Eternal Heart}} || 3.2%
|-
| {{e|Gold Heart|n}} || 3.2%
|}
::* {{e|Half Red Heart}}s, {{e|Half Soul Heart|n}}s and {{e|Blended Heart|n}}s cannot be generated.{{dlc-}}
* {{E|Penny|text=Coins}} can be of any type, with higher value coins, including {{E|Lucky Penny|text=Lucky Pennies}}, and {{E|Sticky Nickel|text=Sticky Nickels}}, being rarer.
* {{E|Bomb}}s and {{E|Key}}s will always be singular (unless Isaac has {{i|BOGO Bombs}} and/or {{i|Humbleing Bundle}}).
* {{dlc|r}} The Book of Sin cannot generate a {{E|Micro Battery|n}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Grants a random wisp based on one of the [[Seven Deadly Sins]]. The wisp spawned isn't linked to the pickup dropped.
** {{e|Pride}}: a blue bomb wisp in the middle ring. When destroyed, a small homing bomb that deals normal troll bomb damage is spawned.
** {{e|Greed}}: 3 yellow coin wisps in the outer ring. Their tears may petrify enemies like {{i|Midas' Touch}}.
** {{e|Wrath}}: an orange bomb wisp in the middle ring, which fire flaming tears. They drop troll bombs when continuously firing, and leave a bomb pickup when they die.
** {{e|Envy}}: a white face-like wisp in the outer ring.
** {{e|Lust}}: a randomly colored pill wisp in the inner ring, with effects that are the same as {{i|Mom's Bottle of Pills}} wisps.
** {{e|Gluttony}}: a heart wisp in the middle ring, with effects that are the same as {{i|Yum Heart}} wisps.
** {{e|Sloth}}: a Bob's Head wisp in the middle ring. Their tears travel in an arc like {{i|Ipecac}} but don't always explode on impact. There is a small chance for an exploding tear.}}

